						<p class="pDate">Saturday, June 14, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">The SYNDICATE RO Empire is Restored! 
						</p>
						<p class=pText>
						Hail all,<BR><BR>The most awaited guild event of the century is upon you. The Syndicate Ro Guild has been restored and we are back up and running, with a whole new website and are now recruiting once again. <BR><BR>LEVELS 20 - 65 are invited to join. We are looking for serious roleplayers.<BR><BR>Syndicate Ro is the most organized, complex, and most fun guild created to date. If you don't believe me go to http://www.syndicatero.com and find out for yourself.<BR><BR>Through our website you fill find extensive materials and resources, each member has their own personal web page they can easily update online, with their biography, level, stats, skills, and so much more!<BR><BR>Our ranking structure is the most complex and original idea in guild history.<BR><BR>We are building more than a guild, we're building a community... a society... an empire. And we are far more than loot and levels, so you must be serious about roleplaying.<BR><BR>If you visit the website syndicatero.com  you'll see what I'm talking about.<BR><BR>Long Live Syndicate Ro.<BR><BR>Prince Venefix Dominixomnis
						<br>
						 - syndicatero<BR><BR>
						</p>
						<p class="sHeader">Comments</p>
						
							<p class="pDate">Monday, June 23, 2003</p>
							
							<p class="pTitle">So what? 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							And you care because...?
							<br>
							 - Shut up<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Don't bother 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							SynRo is not an exciting guild unless you want to bow down to some guy who never even plays anymore.  "Prince" Venefix is like lvl 34, so he can't even raid with the guild, as well, he expects you to pledge fealty to him, and he is an ass.
							<br>
							 - Me<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">mean 
