							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Server has good people 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							I've played on this server for some time, most people are good. Ignore don't bother boy, he sound bitter.
							<br>
							 - fresh air<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Good Luck 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Mr me, Ikk, you sound like the ass. I just visited their site an  all I can say is wow, good luck people. Hope nnever meet Mr me.
							<br>
							 - friend<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Interesting Stuff 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							I looked over the website, looks good to me. I wish you all every success at Syndicate Ro. I know first hand runing guild can be thankless job. My guess the above post comes from a bitter man who must have been kicked out. Pitty the guild that has him as 
							<br>
							 - anon<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">What a shame 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Looks interesting. Shame someone felt like they had to dis you. People like him that can hurt a guild. Good Luck in your efforts.
							<br>
							 - anon<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Indeed 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Fine work Venefix.  I wish you luck and the Blessings of Rallos.  I hope the future bodes well for you. /salute
							<br>
							 - Eloquent Wisewords<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
